label = "rot stink exposure"
description = Color(Long-term exposure to rot stink gas. Rot stink exposure has no direct health effects. However, serious rot stink exposure has a chance to result in a painful bacterial infection known as lung rot. When not exposed to rot stink gas, rot stink exposure will slowly decrease., 1.0)
